{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38298","headline":"无题 一 · 韩偓","name":"无题 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小槛移灯灺，空房锁隙尘。\n额波风尽日，帘影月侵晨。\n香辣更衣後，钗梁拢鬓新。\n吉音闻诡计，醉语近天真。\n妆好方长叹，欢余却浅颦。\n绣屏金作屋，丝幰玉爲轮。\n致意通緜竹，精诚托锦鳞。\n歌凝眉际恨，酒发脸边春。\n溪紵殊倾越，楼箫岂羡秦。\n柳虚禳沴气，梅实引芳津。\n乐府降清唱，宫厨减食珍。\n防闲襟幷敛，忍妬泪休匀。\n宿饮愁萦梦，春寒瘦着人。\n手持双荳蔻，的的爲东邻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38298.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38298","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}